    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Build and Validate Your Dynamic List\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Fetch live data from your API, display it in your card layout, and confirm the data is loading correctly.\r\n\r\nImport your card sketch from Level 2 so you can use it as a guide while building your dynamic list.\r\n\r\n## Build Your List\r\n\r\nWrite code that:\r\n\r\n- uses `async` / `await` to request data from your API\r\n- saves the returned data in a variable\r\n- uses `.map()` to create one card per item\r\n- displays the fields from your card sketch\r\n- inserts the cards into the page as a grid or list\r\n\r\n## Validate Your Data\r\n\r\nTest that your app is using real API data correctly.\r\n\r\nCheck for:\r\n\r\n- missing text\r\n- broken images\r\n- `undefined` values\r\n- cards that do not match your sketch\r\n\r\nUse `console.log`, the Network tab, or AI debugging help to confirm your property names match the API response.\r\n\r\n**Optional:** Temporarily break the endpoint URL and observe what happens. This will prepare you for adding error handling in a later milestone.",
